The agent-status package under this build's own identity (CLAUDE.md > Reference rule): its files are `ngterm-*`
(the wrappers, the Pi extension, the OpenCode plugins), its markers `ngterm-*`, and every variable it reads or sets
`NGTERM_*` (`NGTERM_SESSION_ID`, `NGTERM_SOCKET`, `NGTERM_PANE`, `NGTERMCTL`, `NGTERM_AGENT_RE`, ...). Applied after
0001-linux-glue.patch; an upstream change that brings new agterm names is renamed here the same way.

